#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A check sets a component's state without anyone's hand, and Yuva tells your team when it goes down or up."
msgstr "Pemeriksaan menetapkan status komponen tanpa campur tangan siapa pun, dan Yuva memberi tahu tim Anda saat komponen turun atau pulih."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "a contact and their data"
msgstr "kontak dan datanya"

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "A conversation in the {platform} SDK: a question about an order and the team's replies with a tracking link, and a box to write back."
msgstr "Percakapan di SDK {platform}: pertanyaan tentang pesanan dan balasan tim dengan tautan pelacakan, serta kotak untuk membalas."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A customer can dismiss it. It returns when the incident gets a new update."
msgstr "Pelanggan dapat menutupnya. Muncul lagi saat insiden mendapat pembaruan baru."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "A customer writes to one of your support addresses, for example support@example.com."
msgstr "Seorang pelanggan menulis ke salah satu alamat dukungan Anda, misalnya support@example.com."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "A finished import in the panel: 6 conversations and 12 messages copied from an mbox file, with a note that Yuva has no access to your mailbox."
msgstr "Impor yang selesai di panel: 6 percakapan dan 12 pesan disalin dari berkas mbox, dengan catatan bahwa Yuva tidak punya akses ke kotak surat Anda."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A footer band: a coloured square and the state in words, a strip of 90 days with the uptime, and Status by Yuva."
msgstr "Pita footer: kotak berwarna dan status dalam kata-kata, strip 90 hari dengan uptime, dan Status by Yuva."

#: src/copy/contact.ts
msgid "A hosted service and commercial licenses"
msgstr "Layanan terkelola dan lisensi komersial"

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "A message can be up to 25 MiB including attachments, which is the Cloudflare Email Routing limit. Yuva keeps up to 50 attachments per message, each within the server's attachment size limit (25 MiB by default) and allowed types; it leaves out the rest."
msgstr "Sebuah pesan dapat berukuran hingga 25 MiB termasuk lampiran, yaitu batas Cloudflare Email Routing. Yuva menyimpan hingga 50 lampiran per pesan, masing-masing dalam batas ukuran lampiran server (25 MiB secara bawaan) dan jenis yang diizinkan; sisanya diabaikan."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A notice waits 60 seconds so you can undo it, and notices about one incident keep their distance, so a long outage does not flood inboxes."
msgstr "Pemberitahuan menunggu 60 detik agar Anda bisa membatalkannya, dan pemberitahuan tentang satu insiden diberi jarak, sehingga gangguan panjang tidak membanjiri kotak masuk."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A page stays private until you publish it, and your team previews it in the panel before that."
msgstr "Halaman tetap privat sampai Anda menerbitkannya, dan tim Anda melihat pratinjaunya di panel sebelum itu."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "a personal one is private, even from admins"
msgstr "yang pribadi bersifat privat, bahkan dari admin"

#: src/copy/shadcn.ts
msgid "A project that already uses shadcn/ui, with React and Tailwind CSS."
msgstr "Proyek yang sudah memakai shadcn/ui, dengan React dan Tailwind CSS."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "A public page for the state of your products, kept in the same inbox as your support. Checks keep it current and subscribers hear by e-mail."
msgstr "Halaman publik tentang keadaan produk Anda, di kotak masuk yang sama dengan dukungan Anda. Pemeriksaan menjaganya tetap mutakhir dan pelanggan berlangganan tahu lewat e-mail."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A public status page with components, incidents, maintenance and history, kept current by checks and by your team. E-mail subscribers, a line in the chat widget and the apps, and one reply to everyone who wrote."
msgstr "Halaman status publik dengan komponen, insiden, pemeliharaan, dan riwayat, dijaga tetap mutakhir oleh pemeriksaan dan tim Anda. Pelanggan e-mail, satu baris di widget obrolan dan aplikasi, serta satu balasan untuk semua yang menulis."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A sample status page: the overall state, an open incident and four components with their last 90 days as coloured bars."
msgstr "Contoh halaman status: status keseluruhan, satu insiden terbuka, dan empat komponen dengan 90 hari terakhirnya sebagai batang berwarna."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "A small open-source Worker"
msgstr "Worker open source yang kecil"

#: src/copy/shadcn.ts
msgid "A Yuva chat channel and its public key (yuva_pk_…)."
msgstr "Kanal obrolan Yuva dan kunci publiknya (yuva_pk_…)."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A Yuva status page shows whether your product works. It sits in your support inbox, so your chat widget and apps show an open incident, and one reply answers everyone who wrote about it."
msgstr "Halaman status Yuva menunjukkan apakah produk Anda berfungsi. Halaman ini berada di kotak masuk dukungan Anda, sehingga widget obrolan dan aplikasi menampilkan insiden terbuka, dan satu balasan menjangkau semua yang menulis tentangnya."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "Accepted answer"
msgstr "Jawaban diterima"

