#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "Cloudflare Email Routing becomes the MX of your domain and receives the mail. Yuva does not listen for SMTP, so there is no mail server to install or keep patched."
msgstr "Cloudflare Email Routing menjadi MX domain Anda dan menerima surat. Yuva tidak mendengarkan SMTP, jadi tidak ada server surat yang perlu dipasang atau dijaga tetap mutakhir."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "Cloudflare Email Routing receives the message and passes it to the Yuva Email Worker."
msgstr "Cloudflare Email Routing menerima pesan dan meneruskannya ke Yuva Email Worker."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "Cloudflare, the Cloudflare logo and Cloudflare Workers are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of Cloudflare, Inc. in the United States and other jurisdictions. Yuva is an independent open-source project, not affiliated with or endorsed by Cloudflare."
msgstr "Cloudflare, logo Cloudflare, dan Cloudflare Workers adalah merek dagang dan/atau merek dagang terdaftar dari Cloudflare, Inc. di Amerika Serikat dan yurisdiksi lain. Yuva adalah proyek open source independen, tidak berafiliasi dengan atau didukung oleh Cloudflare."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "Cloudflare® Email Routing receives the mail for your support addresses, and the open-source Yuva Email Worker hands each message to Yuva, signed. It lands in your shared inbox as a conversation your team answers."
msgstr "Cloudflare® Email Routing menerima surat untuk alamat dukungan Anda, dan Yuva Email Worker yang open source menyerahkan setiap pesan ke Yuva, bertanda tangan. Pesan itu masuk ke kotak masuk bersama Anda sebagai percakapan yang dijawab tim Anda."

